{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A peaceful land has been overtaken by dark magic. Countless horrors hunt and kill all who fail to escape. It is up to you to save them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Bleakest Keep is a challenging, dark fantasy action roguelike. Breach the castle and find your way to the top. Find bows, shotguns, or electric cannons to vanquish zombies and creatures that lurk in the darkness. Team up with your dearest Juliet, who\u2019ll upgrade your strength and put an end to the kingdom\u2019s curse once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the first 2 levels of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SURVIVE A RANDOMIZED KEEP!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SLAY SWARMS OF DARK FANTASY CREATURES!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A VARIETY OF WEAPONS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UPGRADE AND MASTER YOUR ABILITIES!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DESTROY POWERFUL BOSSES!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718130?t=1746665681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718130?t=1746665681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718130/3161cf53e903d17a20a7389dc259390e4007d3b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746665681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718130/3161cf53e903d17a20a7389dc259390e4007d3b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746665681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is blood and gore but it is not realistic."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A peaceful land has been overtaken by dark magi